# === Repuro Suite — code-only repo ===
# Whitelist approach: ignore everything at root, then include code dirs

# Ignore everything at root level
/*

# Track code components (the deployable suite)
!/lead-pipeline/
!/dealroom/
!/cockpit/
!/suite/
!/boardroom/

# Track repo config
!/.gitignore

# === Excludes within tracked dirs ===

# Databases (runtime state, not code)
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Environment (machine-specific)
.env

# Python bytecode / venvs
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/

# Binaries (OneDrive handles these)
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.pdf
*.docx
*.pptx
*.CSV
*.zip
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.emf

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.obsidian/
*conflicting copy*
.~lock.*

# Claude local settings
.claude/

# Archived inner git repos
.git-archived/

# Data dirs (runtime, not code)
lead-pipeline/data/staging/
lead-pipeline/data/*.log
lead-pipeline/data/*.json
dealroom/data/deals/
dealroom/AD_Docs/
dealroom/EXAMPLE_LIVE_DEAL_FOLDER/

# One-off scripts (not core pipeline)
lead-pipeline/scripts/ba9_*.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/apply_*.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/correct_*.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/diag_*.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/expand_*.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/fence_*.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/fix_*.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/ownership_only.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/rescrape_ba9_*.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/stage_to_classified.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/sync_ba9*.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/write_ba9_*.py
lead-pipeline/scripts/finish_ba9*.sh
lead-pipeline/scripts/run_ba9*.sh
lead-pipeline/scripts/address_pass.py

# Ephemeral artifacts
**/codex-prompts/
**/codex-reviews/
**/screenshots/
lead-pipeline/2026-*.md
lead-pipeline/260*.md
lead-pipeline/design-system-review-*.md
lead-pipeline/reviews/
report.html
*.tmp
